@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About Us | Tidy but Mighty Cleaning Service — Cleveland, TN</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="Learn about Tidy but Mighty Cleaning Service in Cleveland, TN — 15+ years of reliable, detailed, and affordable residential and commercial cleaning." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://tidybutmightycleaning.com/about" />
</HeadContent>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="hero-eyebrow">About Tidy but Mighty</span>
        <h1>15+ Years of Making Homes &amp; Businesses Shine</h1>
        <p>
            Based in Cleveland, Tennessee, we built Tidy but Mighty Cleaning Service on hard work, genuine care, and attention to the smallest details.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container grid-2" style="align-items: center;">
        <div>
            <img src="images/cover-banner.jpg"
                 alt="Tidy but Mighty Cleaning Service owner and cleaning supplies — Clean Spaces, Happier Places"
                 style="width: 100%; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--border); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);" />
        </div>
        <div>
            <div class="section-eyebrow">Our Promise</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">Reliable, detailed, and affordable — every single visit</h2>
            <p class="card-body" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                We believe a clean space brings real peace of mind. Whether you need weekly upkeep for a busy family home, a one-time deep clean before guests arrive, or dependable commercial cleaning for your office, we show up ready to work with energy and pride.
            </p>
            <p class="card-body" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                Our clients trust us in their homes and businesses because we treat every property like our own — never cutting corners, always communicating clearly, and delivering results you can see the moment you walk through the door.
            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem;">
                <NavLink href="/quote" class="btn btn-primary">Request a Free Estimate</NavLink>
                <a href="https://www.facebook.com/people/Tidy-but-Mighty-Cleaning-Service/61552016452016/"
                   target="_blank"
                   rel="noopener noreferrer"
                   class="btn btn-secondary">
                    Visit Us on Facebook
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

